  engineer> Replacements arrived. Before I fit them, we are also planning to move the fleet to 5.0 — anything that changes for buffering?

  agent> Before replacing anything, confirm the radio is genuinely dead. [RB-101#0] Offset pagination was removed alongside firmware 5.0. [API-006#0] Ingest deduplicates on (device_id, timestamp), but the 5.0 backpressure change means timestamps are no longer evenly spaced, and the dedup window assumed a fixed one-minute grid. [INC-2377#1] Symptoms: the gateway powers on, the status LED is solid amber, and no uplinks reach the platform for more than fifteen minutes. [RB-101#0]

